<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>oko.loc.cc</title>
<meta name="description" content="oko.loc.cc — 站点建设中">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#fbfbf9;
    --ink:#1c1c1a;
    --muted:#6b6b66;
    --line:#e4e3dd;
    --accent:#185fa5;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:32px 24px;
    line-height:1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  main{max-width:560px;width:100%}
  .dot{
    display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;
    background:#1d9e75;margin-right:9px;vertical-align:middle;
    animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.dot{animation:none}}
  .status{
    font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,42px);
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
    line-height:1.2;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  h1 span{color:var(--accent)}
  p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);max-width:44ch}
  p + p{margin-top:12px}
  hr{
    border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    margin:34px 0 22px;
  }
  footer{
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;
    font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
  }
  footer a{
    color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .18s,color .18s;
  }
  footer a:hover{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
  code{
    font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.92em;background:#f1efe8;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>站点已上线 · GitHub Pages</div>

  <h1>这里以后是<br><span>oko.loc.cc</span></h1>

  <p>域名解析和托管都通了，页面还是块白板。接下来要做的就是把这个文件替换成真正的站点内容。</p>
  <p>改完 <code>index.html</code> 推上去，GitHub 会自动重新部署，一般一两分钟生效。</p>

  <hr>

  <footer>
    <span>© <span id="y">2026</span> oko.loc.cc</span>
    <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
  </footer>
</main>
<script>
  document.getElementById('y').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
